#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client so you can run jobs with IBM Quantum Compute Service."
msgstr "Instala el cliente de IBM Quantum Compute para poder ejecutar trabajos con IBM Quantum Compute Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client"
msgstr "Instalar el cliente de IBM Quantum Compute"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client}"
msgstr "Instalar el cliente de IBM Quantum Compute {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service is the cloud-based service for executing quantum computations on IBM Quantum&reg; hardware. This guide shows you how to install `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, which is the client package for accessing IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Compute Service es el servicio basado en la nube para ejecutar cálculos cuánticos en hardware de IBM Quantum&reg;. Esta guía te muestra cómo instalar `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, que es el paquete cliente para acceder a IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before installing the `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, follow the instructions in these guides:\n"
msgstr "Antes de instalar `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, sigue las instrucciones de estas guías:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit). \n"
msgstr "[Instalar Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up your IBM Cloud account](cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Configurar tu cuenta de IBM Cloud](cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run this command to install the IBM Quantum Compute client:\n"
msgstr "Ejecuta este comando para instalar el cliente de IBM Quantum Compute:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
"Periodically check the [`qiskit-ibm-runtime` release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit-ibm-runtime` by running `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mantente al día con las últimas versiones\">\n"
"Consulta periódicamente las [notas de versión de `qiskit-ibm-runtime`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) para ver las nuevas versiones. Recomendamos actualizar frecuentemente los requisitos de `qiskit-ibm-runtime` ejecutando `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Próximos pasos {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Review the [deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendaciones\">\n"
"  - [Instalar el SDK de Qiskit desde el código fuente](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Ejecuta tu primer programa](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Prueba un tutorial, como [el algoritmo de Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Revisa la [política de obsolescencia](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
